OL,3,GNEWSATrump meeting Irish leader Micheal
OL,4,AMartin during visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump is in Ireland
OL,7,Ffor a two-day visit.
OL,9,FHe has arrived at Farmleigh House to
OL,10,Fmeet Taoiseach (Irish Prime Minister)
OL,11,FMicheal Martin.
OL,13,FHis first visit was to the Aras an
OL,14,FUachtarain - the official residence of
OL,15,Fthe Irish president - to hold a
OL,16,Fcourtesy call with Irish President
OL,17,FCatherine Connolly.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
